====== Linksys EA7300 v2======

Gigabit Ethernet switch based device, USB 3.0 port, 2.4GHz and 5GHz WiFi-5 support.  Four total antennas, one internal, with three external. The three antennas are fixed and cannot be removed.  Dual-firmware support allows you to switch back to the stock firmware.


